WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.780 line:85%
A storm rolled over Cell 7,
and I stayed up with it.

2
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.660 line:85%
By morning, fresh soil lay
in every crack of the rock.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.120 line:85%
By dark, the meadow was whole again,

4
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.000 line:85%
and both pools were full.

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.600 line:85%
Ember sent word from
the island to the east.

6
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.860 line:85%
A fire came nine months ago,
but skipped one gully.

7
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.800 line:85%
She took ten cuttings there,

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.200 line:85%
wrapped in wet moss.

9
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.180 line:85%
“Could you plant them close together,
so each one shades the next?”
